WEBVTT

00:33.241 --> 00:37.954
‎AGENT KIM REACTIVATED

00:39.122 --> 00:41.166
‎EPISODE 1

01:05.523 --> 01:07.067
‎Are you kidding me right now?

01:07.150 --> 01:10.278
‎Move your car! It's blocking the road!

01:10.361 --> 01:11.446
‎Goodness gracious.

01:15.492 --> 01:16.951
‎Jeez, just walk if you're in a rush.

01:17.035 --> 01:18.536
‎I'm starving. When will the food be ready?

01:18.620 --> 01:20.747
‎I know. It's taking so long.

01:23.500 --> 01:25.460
‎When is our food going to be ready?

01:50.235 --> 01:51.611
‎You're drunk!

01:54.989 --> 01:55.824
‎What was that?

01:57.367 --> 01:59.828
‎Damn it. What the hell?

02:01.204 --> 02:03.331
‎Hey, you. Come here.

02:03.414 --> 02:05.542
‎Damn it, it's broken.

02:05.625 --> 02:07.585
‎Goddamn it. Come here.

02:08.878 --> 02:10.547
‎Hey, I said come here!

02:11.673 --> 02:12.799
‎Where the hell are you going?

02:12.882 --> 02:14.384
‎Hey!

02:14.467 --> 02:15.718
‎Who do you think you are?

02:15.802 --> 02:18.221
‎Are you pulling
‎an insurance scam or something?

02:18.304 --> 02:20.014
‎If you bump into someone's car,

02:20.098 --> 02:25.186
‎you should be down on your knees
‎begging for forgiveness.

02:25.270 --> 02:27.188
‎This needs to be replaced entirely.

02:27.272 --> 02:28.773
‎I wonder how much it'll cost.

02:28.857 --> 02:30.733
‎I think my arm is okay,

02:31.359 --> 02:32.569
‎so you can just go.

02:33.361 --> 02:35.738
‎Man, you're unbelievable.

02:36.364 --> 02:39.200
‎I'm really okay, so you can leave.

02:40.243 --> 02:42.871
‎Are you serious right now?

02:42.954 --> 02:45.623
‎Have you lost your damn mind?

02:45.707 --> 02:46.749
‎Do you have a death wish?

02:49.377 --> 02:50.253
‎What?

02:53.548 --> 02:54.507
‎What are you looking at?

02:59.596 --> 03:00.597
‎I'm sorry.

03:02.140 --> 03:03.433
‎I apologize.

03:03.516 --> 03:04.475
‎It's too late for that.

03:04.559 --> 03:06.102
‎Try running your mouth again.

03:06.185 --> 03:08.438
‎Come on, let's get going. We're late.

03:08.521 --> 03:09.355
‎Let's go.

03:10.356 --> 03:11.274
‎Go on, then.

03:11.858 --> 03:13.026
‎I'll accept your apology.

03:13.943 --> 03:15.069
‎Let's call it even with this.

03:17.155 --> 03:19.866
‎Wow, have you been working out these days?

03:19.949 --> 03:21.576
‎-That was a nice punch.
‎-Is he dead?

03:21.659 --> 03:23.745
‎-Should we cover him with a blanket?
‎-Goddamn it!

04:01.407 --> 04:03.284
‎AGENT KIM REACTIVATED

04:03.868 --> 04:05.078
‎Good morning!

04:05.161 --> 04:06.454
‎I think you're missing a button.

04:06.537 --> 04:07.622
‎-I don't think so.
‎-Are you sure?

04:08.414 --> 04:10.083
‎Let me sweep this for you.

04:10.166 --> 04:11.251
‎No, it's okay.

04:11.334 --> 04:13.169
‎-Let me do it for you.
‎-Thank you.

04:42.448 --> 04:43.741
‎YOUR CHILD'S REBELLIOUS PHASE

05:22.155 --> 05:23.239
‎KIM MIN-JI

05:40.381 --> 05:41.507
‎RESTRICTED AREA

05:41.591 --> 05:43.634
‎Min-ji, wake up.

05:47.597 --> 05:48.806
‎ENTER WITHOUT PERMISSION AND YOU'LL DIE!

05:49.932 --> 05:50.850
‎Min-ji.

05:57.065 --> 05:59.275
‎Kim Min-ji, you're late!

05:59.776 --> 06:01.652
‎-It's time for break--
‎-Enough about breakfast!

06:02.904 --> 06:06.491
‎Does anyone give you crap
‎if I skip breakfast?

06:07.325 --> 06:09.118
‎Don't smile!

06:09.202 --> 06:10.453
‎You're a student,

06:10.536 --> 06:12.622
‎so you need a solid meal before school.

06:17.335 --> 06:18.628
‎Kim Min-ji!

06:26.469 --> 06:28.805
‎SCHOOL NOTICE
‎EMERGENCY CONTACT FORM

06:34.143 --> 06:35.561
‎MOTHER: X
‎SIBLINGS: X

06:35.645 --> 06:36.479
‎Hey, Min-ji.

06:36.562 --> 06:38.189
‎I need the name of a close friend

06:38.272 --> 06:40.066
‎and their phone number.

06:42.151 --> 06:43.444
‎Kim Min-ji!

06:43.528 --> 06:44.529
‎Kang Hye-ryeong.

06:44.612 --> 06:46.948
‎Her number is 010-0610-6003.

06:49.617 --> 06:51.702
‎I filled out the form.
‎Have some breakfast.

06:51.786 --> 06:52.620
‎I'm late.

06:52.703 --> 06:54.997
‎-Your report card…
‎-Don't look at that!

06:55.081 --> 06:58.376
‎-Level eight? What happened?
‎-The higher the number, the better.

06:58.459 --> 07:00.128
‎-Right?
‎-The rules have changed.

07:00.211 --> 07:01.295
‎I told you before.

07:01.379 --> 07:03.297
‎-Take it easy on the studying.
‎-Okay.

07:06.968 --> 07:07.802
‎Kang…

07:08.469 --> 07:09.345
‎Hye…

07:10.680 --> 07:11.556
‎ryeong.

07:21.107 --> 07:22.608
‎LAUNDRY

07:22.692 --> 07:23.693
‎Min-ji!

07:24.819 --> 07:25.736
‎Min-ji!

07:26.446 --> 07:27.613
‎-Hello.
‎-Hey.

07:27.697 --> 07:28.865
‎How's your father doing?

07:28.948 --> 07:31.284
‎-What do you mean?
‎-Well, the thugs…

07:32.285 --> 07:33.327
‎Never mind.

07:33.411 --> 07:35.746
‎By the way,
‎why don't you alter your uniform?

07:35.830 --> 07:38.458
‎I'm an expert at altering, you know.

07:38.541 --> 07:40.710
‎It's okay. I never know
‎when I'll be transferring again.

07:41.461 --> 07:42.378
‎That's my bus.

07:42.462 --> 07:43.546
‎What?

07:51.137 --> 07:52.096
‎Have a good day.

07:52.638 --> 07:56.350
‎Gosh, her uniform
‎is always perfectly pressed.

07:59.353 --> 08:01.147
‎Mr. Kim!

08:01.230 --> 08:02.857
‎Are you okay?

08:02.940 --> 08:04.358
‎You seem okay.

08:04.442 --> 08:06.277
‎I saw those thugs
‎provoking you that night.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.321
‎I'm sorry I couldn't step in.

08:08.404 --> 08:10.031
‎I'm quite the scaredy-cat, you see.

08:10.114 --> 08:11.699
‎I would've done the same in your shoes.

08:12.992 --> 08:14.869
‎Goodness, Mr. Kim.

08:14.952 --> 08:17.330
‎You should really press your suit.

08:17.413 --> 08:20.541
‎That's what a dry cleaner is for.

08:20.625 --> 08:23.920
‎Come on, you live right above one.

08:24.003 --> 08:26.047
‎That just hurts my pride.

08:26.797 --> 08:28.216
‎I'll drop it off next time.

08:28.299 --> 08:31.177
‎I'll press this for you in a jiffy.
‎Let's go inside.

08:31.260 --> 08:32.762
‎-Come on.
‎-I have to catch the bus.

08:32.845 --> 08:34.430
‎Let me press it for you.

08:34.514 --> 08:35.723
‎Wait.

08:36.516 --> 08:37.725
‎Mr. Kim.

08:37.808 --> 08:38.684
‎Mr. Kim!

08:40.520 --> 08:43.397
‎Jeez. Like father, like daughter.

08:43.481 --> 08:45.399
‎They're exactly the same.

08:46.609 --> 08:48.903
‎My sales pitch never works on them.

08:52.615 --> 08:53.449
‎Wait!

08:53.533 --> 08:54.742
‎Thank you.

09:17.974 --> 09:20.101
‎Sorry, coming through.

09:24.272 --> 09:26.232
‎Don't push!

09:50.423 --> 09:51.507
‎Don't run. You'll get hurt.

09:51.591 --> 09:53.843
‎SCHOOL VIOLENCE
‎DON'T STAND BY, PROTECT VICTIMS!

09:54.427 --> 09:56.387
‎-Did you have breakfast?
‎-Yes, sir.

09:56.470 --> 09:58.014
‎-Good morning, sir.
‎-Hey.

09:58.097 --> 09:59.557
‎-You need to say hello like this.
‎-You're right.

10:05.104 --> 10:06.981
‎SANGSAENG SAVINGS BANK

10:08.649 --> 10:10.568
‎Hello, Manager Kim.
‎You're first as always.

10:10.651 --> 10:11.527
‎Hello.

10:12.653 --> 10:15.489
‎SAVINGS BANK
‎LOAN APPLICATIONS & INQUIRIES

10:20.244 --> 10:22.038
‎Customer number 155, please.

10:26.250 --> 10:27.501
‎CORPORATE CARD CHARGES

10:27.585 --> 10:28.836
‎SEOREUNG CO., LTD. / CHINESE FOOD

10:31.631 --> 10:33.090
‎REQUESTER: KANG HAK-SU
‎DIVISION: TREASURY

10:34.383 --> 10:35.217
‎LEAVE REQUEST HISTORY

10:42.808 --> 10:46.562
‎I've taken a look at your assets, and…

10:47.772 --> 10:48.689
‎Sir.

10:48.773 --> 10:49.815
‎What is it?

10:49.899 --> 10:52.234
‎These are the corporate card charges.

10:52.318 --> 10:56.405
‎You charged 95,000 won for Chinese food
‎the Wednesday before last.

10:56.489 --> 10:57.490
‎So?

10:57.573 --> 11:01.118
‎You were on leave that day
‎for your wedding anniversary.

11:01.202 --> 11:03.746
‎The receipt is missing as well,
‎so maybe there was an oversight?

11:04.955 --> 11:07.083
‎Kim, do you eat a lot of fish
‎for brain food?

11:07.667 --> 11:08.501
‎Excuse me?

11:08.584 --> 11:09.669
‎How is your memory so good?

11:09.752 --> 11:14.382
‎Oh, well, I do try to eat a lot of fish.
‎I like mackerel in particular.

11:15.257 --> 11:17.259
‎Stop eating mackerel and saury

11:17.343 --> 11:20.221
‎and learn how to bend the rules instead.

11:20.304 --> 11:21.472
‎Be flexible.

11:22.473 --> 11:24.683
‎Just write it off
‎as a company dinner expense.

11:28.020 --> 11:28.854
‎Yes, sir.

11:29.480 --> 11:31.524
‎I'll write it off
‎as a company dinner expense.

11:32.191 --> 11:36.821
‎Thank you so much
‎for remembering my wedding anniversary.

11:36.904 --> 11:37.780
‎No problem.

11:41.158 --> 11:43.244
‎Jeez, he's so frustrating.

11:44.578 --> 11:46.080
‎PLEASE USE THE NEXT COUNTER

11:50.459 --> 11:51.585
‎Let's call it even with this.

11:56.382 --> 11:59.301
‎SELF-DEFENSE ITEMS

12:01.846 --> 12:05.266
‎I have to pre-order and stand in line
‎just to get some dessert?

12:05.349 --> 12:06.475
‎What time does this start?

12:12.189 --> 12:13.899
‎-Mr. Kim.
‎-Jeez, you scared me!

12:13.983 --> 12:15.025
‎What is it, Sang-a?

12:15.609 --> 12:17.862
‎Is something wrong?
‎Why are you looking up self-defense items?

12:17.945 --> 12:19.780
‎Oh, it's nothing.

12:20.656 --> 12:22.741
‎Wait, are you going to use it at night…

12:24.493 --> 12:25.870
‎on Mr. Kang?

12:25.953 --> 12:27.246
‎Mr. Kang?

12:27.329 --> 12:28.164
‎Of course not.

12:29.290 --> 12:30.666
‎It's not that.

12:30.749 --> 12:32.877
‎My neighborhood feels unsafe these days.

12:35.588 --> 12:36.589
‎Hey, Sang-a.

12:36.672 --> 12:39.091
‎This looks useful, right?

12:39.175 --> 12:41.719
‎It's easy to carry around
‎and seems effective.

12:42.928 --> 12:44.013
‎Is it for you?

12:44.096 --> 12:45.347
‎I think it's for women.

12:45.431 --> 12:47.391
‎Min-ji's birthday is coming up.

12:47.475 --> 12:49.393
‎Oh, it's your daughter's birthday.

12:49.477 --> 12:50.561
‎How old is she?

12:51.604 --> 12:52.605
‎She's a high school junior.

12:54.773 --> 12:56.984
‎A self-defense item
‎for a high school girl…

12:59.236 --> 13:02.281
‎Why don't you just ask her what she wants?

13:02.364 --> 13:03.908
‎I'd like to,

13:03.991 --> 13:06.410
‎but she won't talk to me these days.

13:06.494 --> 13:07.953
‎She just avoids me.

13:08.454 --> 13:10.331
‎Sounds like she's going through
‎a late rebellious phase.

13:10.414 --> 13:12.833
‎Don't worry so much.
‎They're all like that at that age.

13:13.876 --> 13:16.045
‎Maybe things might be better
‎if her mom was around.

13:20.257 --> 13:23.093
‎I'll help you choose a gift.

13:23.886 --> 13:26.222
‎-Really?
‎-I'm going to the department store anyway.

13:26.305 --> 13:27.556
‎Let's go together after work.

13:28.641 --> 13:29.600
‎No, you don't have to do--

13:29.683 --> 13:31.727
‎We'll leave at six o'clock sharp.

13:36.065 --> 13:37.316
‎Hey, Kim Min-ji.

13:37.399 --> 13:38.484
‎Min-ji.

13:38.567 --> 13:39.693
‎Lend me your gym clothes.

13:39.777 --> 13:43.322
‎Hye-ryeong, you didn't return them
‎the last time, so I had to track you down.

13:43.405 --> 13:46.367
‎Come on, we're friends. I'm begging you.

13:48.452 --> 13:49.286
‎What's this?

13:52.081 --> 13:53.624
‎Thank you. I'll bring it right back.

14:01.215 --> 14:02.883
‎Jeez, wash your clothes.

14:04.301 --> 14:05.719
‎Hey, Ju Hye-ri, what's this?

14:06.804 --> 14:08.347
‎My dad got it for me on his business trip.

14:08.430 --> 14:09.848
‎It's so pretty.

14:09.932 --> 14:12.643
‎-I've never seen this from this brand.
‎-Me neither.

14:12.726 --> 14:13.811
‎It's not available in Korea.

14:13.894 --> 14:15.062
‎It's limited edition.

14:15.813 --> 14:17.648
‎Mine's just cheap fast-fashion.

14:17.731 --> 14:19.692
‎I'm so jealous, Hye-ri.

14:19.775 --> 14:20.985
‎Yeah, yours looks cheap.

14:21.068 --> 14:21.902
‎Does it really?

14:21.986 --> 14:24.989
‎-How much was it?
‎-It was 5,000 won.

14:25.072 --> 14:25.948
‎What's with her?

14:27.116 --> 14:28.075
‎Has she lost her mind?

14:28.158 --> 14:29.243
‎Forget it.

14:29.326 --> 14:30.578
‎Leave her alone.

14:30.661 --> 14:32.288
‎You'll get that old widower reek on you.

14:34.039 --> 14:35.332
‎Hey, it's Kim Nam-hoon.

14:35.416 --> 14:38.460
‎He's not even trying to hide
‎that he's here to see Hye-ri.

14:39.545 --> 14:40.963
‎Hye-ri, do you have a minute?

14:56.896 --> 14:57.938
‎Hey, dude.

15:00.900 --> 15:01.734
‎WOMEN

15:02.318 --> 15:03.861
‎Hey, what flavor was that again?

15:03.944 --> 15:04.862
‎Grape.

15:04.945 --> 15:06.530
‎-Can I try it?
‎-No.

15:06.614 --> 15:08.324
‎-Come on, let me hit it once.
‎-Smoke your own.

15:08.407 --> 15:09.283
‎Okay, okay.

15:09.783 --> 15:11.493
‎-One more puff.
‎-No.

15:12.328 --> 15:13.454
‎-Let's swap.
‎-No.

15:13.537 --> 15:16.624
‎-Come on, just for a day.
‎-I said no. I like this flavor.

15:16.707 --> 15:17.708
‎Hey.

15:19.460 --> 15:21.587
‎Damn, it reeks like an old widower here.

15:22.838 --> 15:25.341
‎The cigarette smell on you is worse.

15:27.801 --> 15:29.011
‎What did you just say?

15:30.429 --> 15:31.805
‎I asked you a question.

15:32.681 --> 15:33.849
‎Don't look at me like that.

15:33.933 --> 15:35.392
‎I said don't look at me like that!

15:35.476 --> 15:36.560
‎Hey!

15:37.269 --> 15:38.520
‎That's enough.

15:39.647 --> 15:42.358
‎Stop picking on that pathetic kid.

15:43.901 --> 15:45.152
‎Why am I pathetic?

15:53.744 --> 15:56.372
‎I mean, just look at you.

15:56.872 --> 15:58.040
‎You're pathetic.

16:18.644 --> 16:21.772
‎SANGSAENG SAVINGS BANK

16:25.567 --> 16:26.610
‎Mr. Kim!

16:27.987 --> 16:30.322
‎-Hi, Sang-a.
‎-Let's go get your daughter's gift.

16:31.115 --> 16:32.366
‎Did you mean it earlier?

16:32.950 --> 16:34.368
‎Seriously? I'm hurt.

16:35.202 --> 16:37.746
‎I mean, are you sure?
‎I don't want to be a nuisance.

16:37.830 --> 16:39.456
‎If you don't want to, then no worries.

16:39.540 --> 16:40.541
‎Goodbye.

16:44.003 --> 16:45.045
‎Sang-a!

16:45.129 --> 16:46.422
‎Wait.

16:55.931 --> 16:56.765
‎Sang-a.

17:07.693 --> 17:08.527
‎There it is.

17:13.198 --> 17:14.116
‎PRE-ORDER LINE

17:17.703 --> 17:19.288
‎-What the heck?
‎-Mr. Kim.

17:20.414 --> 17:21.457
‎What's this?

17:23.042 --> 17:24.668
‎-Give me your credit card.
‎-My credit card?

17:24.752 --> 17:26.170
‎It'll only take longer if we go together.

17:26.253 --> 17:29.548
‎You can wait in line here
‎while I buy your daughter's gift.

17:29.631 --> 17:31.008
‎It's a win-win situation.

17:37.681 --> 17:40.976
‎I texted you a screenshot
‎of my pre-order DM,

17:41.060 --> 17:42.853
‎so you just have to pick it up
‎when it's your turn.

17:44.063 --> 17:44.897
‎A screenshot?

17:46.106 --> 17:46.940
‎Hold on.

17:50.069 --> 17:52.571
‎I can't view photos on my phone.

18:08.545 --> 18:10.756
‎How many zeros is this?

18:11.548 --> 18:12.508
‎What? 500,000 won?

18:12.591 --> 18:14.426
‎Next in line, please.

18:15.844 --> 18:16.762
‎Oh, right.

18:16.845 --> 18:18.347
‎I need to confirm your pre-order.

18:20.182 --> 18:22.059
‎It's under Jung Sang-a.

18:22.142 --> 18:24.978
‎Not the name.
‎I need to see the pre-order DM.

18:25.062 --> 18:26.230
‎What's a DM?

18:26.313 --> 18:29.233
‎If your pre-order isn't confirmed,
‎you'll have to move to the walk-in line.

18:30.859 --> 18:31.693
‎WALK-IN LINE

18:34.321 --> 18:36.031
‎But she said she pre-ordered--

18:36.115 --> 18:38.534
‎-Next in line, please.
‎-Jeez, come on.

18:40.160 --> 18:40.994
‎Here.

18:41.954 --> 18:43.956
‎Okay, you're all set.

18:44.039 --> 18:44.873
‎Thank you.

18:49.253 --> 18:52.464
‎Come on, Mr. Kim.
‎It's your daughter's birthday.

18:53.257 --> 18:55.467
‎I'm sorry, but I'd like a refund.

18:55.551 --> 18:57.678
‎Just a minute, please.

19:01.849 --> 19:04.685
‎I stay on top of current trends, you know.

19:04.768 --> 19:07.855
‎This is the trend these days.
‎Just trust me and buy it.

19:07.938 --> 19:09.731
‎My daughter is in high school.

19:09.815 --> 19:12.943
‎It makes no sense for a high schooler
‎to wear a T-shirt that costs 500,000 won.

19:13.819 --> 19:15.946
‎-Refund, please.
‎-Yes, it's expensive.

19:16.029 --> 19:19.825
‎But this is the secret weapon
‎to get through her rebellious phase.

19:19.908 --> 19:22.369
‎Imagine the worst-case scenario.

19:22.870 --> 19:23.704
‎"Worst-case"?

19:23.787 --> 19:25.664
‎"As my dad,
‎what have you ever done for me?"

19:26.623 --> 19:29.585
‎If she says that, it'll be the end
‎of your father-daughter relationship.

19:29.668 --> 19:33.589
‎You need to do something big
‎to prepare for the worst-case scenario

19:33.672 --> 19:35.382
‎and say something back to her.

19:36.008 --> 19:38.135
‎"I bought you a 500,000 won T-shirt!"

19:41.305 --> 19:42.306
‎Something like that.

19:42.389 --> 19:44.266
‎This is super popular
‎among kids these days.

19:44.933 --> 19:48.020
‎She'll think, "My out-of-touch dad
‎is actually pretty cool."

19:48.729 --> 19:50.189
‎I bet she'll look at you differently.

20:44.785 --> 20:46.620
‎Min-ji, I'm home.

20:48.747 --> 20:50.123
‎When did you get home?

20:52.834 --> 20:54.002
‎What are you doing?

20:56.129 --> 20:56.964
‎Kim Min-ji.

20:57.589 --> 20:58.507
‎I'm talking to you.

20:59.341 --> 21:01.885
‎Don't wash your clothes with mine anymore.

21:01.969 --> 21:03.679
‎They make mine smell like an old man.

21:11.311 --> 21:12.437
‎All right.

21:12.521 --> 21:13.522
‎Then from now on,

21:14.273 --> 21:15.357
‎do your own laundry.

21:43.719 --> 21:44.720
‎JU HYE-RI

22:04.823 --> 22:05.782
‎PEOPLE TAGGED IN THIS PHOTO

22:06.283 --> 22:07.242
‎KIM NAM-HOON

22:19.588 --> 22:22.674
‎Wait, why can't I unlike this?

22:23.633 --> 22:24.718
‎Who are you?

22:35.437 --> 22:36.605
‎Oh gosh.

22:49.117 --> 22:49.951
‎Dad.

22:58.752 --> 22:59.878
‎Go to sleep in your room.

23:02.005 --> 23:02.839
‎What is it, Min-ji?

23:02.923 --> 23:04.424
‎I said go to sleep in your room.

23:05.008 --> 23:05.842
‎Right.

23:17.062 --> 23:17.896
‎Dad.

23:20.816 --> 23:21.650
‎Yeah?

23:25.320 --> 23:26.738
‎About what I said earlier…

23:26.822 --> 23:29.074
‎I forgot to do the dishes.

23:31.451 --> 23:33.120
‎You can do it in the morning.

23:33.203 --> 23:35.122
‎Just go sleep.

23:39.584 --> 23:41.670
‎Okay. You should go to bed too.

23:53.098 --> 23:54.432
‎Good morning!

23:54.516 --> 23:56.434
‎I think you're missing a button.

23:56.518 --> 23:57.519
‎You sure it's okay?

23:57.602 --> 23:59.020
‎DOWON LAUNDRY

24:23.628 --> 24:24.754
‎What's gotten into her?

24:27.799 --> 24:29.050
‎All right, then.

24:30.510 --> 24:32.262
‎I'll make Min-ji's favorite.

24:33.180 --> 24:34.598
‎Soy sauce egg rice.

24:45.150 --> 24:46.943
‎-Hey!
‎-I need my gym clothes.

25:07.464 --> 25:09.090
‎Did you see the look on her face?

25:12.344 --> 25:14.846
‎-Hye-ryeong, wake up.
‎-What is it?

25:14.930 --> 25:17.057
‎I have PE next period.
‎Where are my gym clothes?

25:17.140 --> 25:18.475
‎I gave them back to you.

25:18.558 --> 25:20.852
‎When? I never got them.

25:20.936 --> 25:22.938
‎I left them on your desk.

25:26.149 --> 25:27.150
‎Hurry up.

25:29.277 --> 25:30.487
‎Hey, Min-ji.

25:30.570 --> 25:32.155
‎Check the trash can.

25:39.996 --> 25:41.957
‎KIM MIN-JI

26:01.393 --> 26:03.061
‎Did you see the look on her face?

26:24.291 --> 26:26.584
‎I just played volleyball,
‎so it'll smell like sweat.

26:27.127 --> 26:27.961
‎What?

26:35.093 --> 26:37.387
‎Five-on-five match in ten minutes!

26:37.470 --> 26:39.389
‎The losing team will clean for a month.

26:40.432 --> 26:41.266
‎Min-ji.

26:41.808 --> 26:42.934
‎Kim Min-ji, come here.

26:43.810 --> 26:44.894
‎Why are you only wearing

26:45.687 --> 26:46.813
‎half of your gym clothes?

26:46.896 --> 26:48.773
‎Are you going to play basketball
‎in a skirt?

26:48.857 --> 26:50.275
‎-I forgot.
‎-"Kim Nam-hoon"?

26:51.276 --> 26:52.944
‎Nam-hoon didn't lend you his pants?

27:00.035 --> 27:01.953
‎All right, double punch! One!

27:02.037 --> 27:03.496
‎-Taekwon!
‎-Taekwon!

27:03.580 --> 27:04.414
‎Two!

27:04.497 --> 27:06.249
‎-Taekwon!
‎-Taekwon!

27:06.333 --> 27:07.959
‎Now, triple punch! One!

27:08.043 --> 27:10.003
‎-Taekwondo!
‎-Taekwondo!

27:10.086 --> 27:10.920
‎Two!

27:11.004 --> 27:12.630
‎-Taekwondo!
‎-Taekwondo!

27:12.714 --> 27:13.590
‎Back to ready!

27:13.673 --> 27:15.633
‎Kicking stance, ready!

27:16.801 --> 27:17.802
‎One!

27:19.471 --> 27:20.472
‎Two!

27:21.639 --> 27:22.640
‎Proper mind!

27:22.724 --> 27:23.558
‎Nice!

27:23.641 --> 27:25.352
‎Proper body! Nice.

27:25.435 --> 27:26.978
‎Proper posture!

27:27.062 --> 27:28.313
‎Proper…

27:29.397 --> 27:30.523
‎Proper…

27:30.607 --> 27:31.566
‎Proper…

27:31.649 --> 27:32.692
‎Whatever!

27:33.526 --> 27:35.028
‎I wasn't done.

27:36.738 --> 27:38.073
‎That's it for today.

27:38.156 --> 27:39.366
‎Let's go play!

27:42.660 --> 27:43.828
‎Come on.

27:48.917 --> 27:49.751
‎It's okay.

27:51.169 --> 27:52.045
‎My goodness.

27:53.671 --> 27:57.175
‎I can't tell if this is a Taekwondo studio
‎or a daycare center.

27:57.258 --> 27:59.094
‎Jin-cheol, why would you…

28:00.053 --> 28:02.222
‎Jeez, Jin-cheol.
‎What's the matter with you?

28:02.305 --> 28:03.306
‎Jin-cheol!

28:14.901 --> 28:15.902
‎Hey.

28:16.820 --> 28:18.154
‎Who asked that person to help out?

28:18.238 --> 28:20.281
‎No one did.

28:28.456 --> 28:29.833
‎Let's cross the road!

28:29.916 --> 28:31.709
‎Come on, kids. Let's cross now!

28:31.793 --> 28:33.336
‎-You can cross the road.
‎-Go slowly.

28:33.420 --> 28:35.171
‎Cross the road, kids!

28:35.255 --> 28:37.173
‎I said cross the road!

28:37.257 --> 28:39.384
‎Go ahead. What's wrong?

28:39.467 --> 28:41.010
‎Why aren't you crossing?

28:41.094 --> 28:42.929
‎-Mommy, I'm scared!
‎-Are you scared of the cars?

28:43.012 --> 28:45.014
‎Goodness, let me help you.

28:45.098 --> 28:47.142
‎-Here we go.
‎-Let's go!

28:51.312 --> 28:52.313
‎All right.

28:53.481 --> 28:54.524
‎Oh my!

28:54.607 --> 28:56.025
‎My goodness, sir!

28:56.109 --> 28:58.153
‎Where are you going?

28:58.236 --> 28:59.237
‎Over there?

28:59.320 --> 29:01.114
‎Got it! All right.

29:01.197 --> 29:03.700
‎-Let's go!
‎-Wait!

29:04.659 --> 29:07.746
‎-Is he stealing the cart?
‎-Surely not. He's probably just helping.

29:07.829 --> 29:08.872
‎I have to go this way!

29:08.955 --> 29:10.582
‎No!

29:10.665 --> 29:12.041
‎It's this way!

29:14.002 --> 29:16.171
‎How wonderful is it

29:16.254 --> 29:17.714
‎to be needed

29:18.506 --> 29:19.841
‎and to help others?

29:20.633 --> 29:22.260
‎In these dark and rough times,

29:22.343 --> 29:24.721
‎I will be a positive force
‎and a guiding light.

29:25.346 --> 29:28.516
‎You did well today, Park Jin-cheol.

29:34.564 --> 29:35.523
‎KOREAN MARINE VETERANS FEDERATION

29:51.956 --> 29:53.416
‎Copy that. Start operation.

29:53.500 --> 29:55.960
‎Unit 911, fall back. I'm taking the lead.

29:56.044 --> 29:56.878
‎Grenade out.

29:56.961 --> 29:58.630
‎Out of the way. That's it!

29:58.713 --> 30:00.673
‎Get out of the way. That's it.

30:00.757 --> 30:01.966
‎Act like true Marines!

30:02.050 --> 30:03.384
‎Grenade out! Fall back!

30:03.468 --> 30:04.302
‎Bomb!

30:06.554 --> 30:07.388
‎PURE TAEKWONDO

30:10.266 --> 30:12.060
‎Retreat! Fall back!

30:12.143 --> 30:14.854
‎Don't come out! Move aside!

30:14.938 --> 30:17.649
‎Hey! Didn't you hear what I just said?

30:17.732 --> 30:18.691
‎Get them!

30:19.317 --> 30:20.944
‎I'll do it!

30:21.027 --> 30:22.320
‎Oh, damn it.

30:22.403 --> 30:23.279
‎Hold on.

30:24.405 --> 30:25.281
‎Did you hear something?

30:25.949 --> 30:27.033
‎Don't make any footsteps.

30:34.541 --> 30:38.294
‎What's that noise? A bomb. It's a bomb!

30:45.677 --> 30:46.719
‎Hey.

30:46.803 --> 30:47.887
‎You were in here?

30:49.848 --> 30:53.810
‎Man, all I did was kick in a door,
‎and now my leg hurts.

30:53.893 --> 30:54.853
‎Gosh, it hurts.

30:58.857 --> 31:01.526
‎What are you looking at?

31:01.609 --> 31:03.528
‎Why aren't you greeting your senior?

31:03.611 --> 31:04.821
‎You crazy little…

31:05.905 --> 31:07.282
‎Don't you know how to knock?

31:07.365 --> 31:10.326
‎Why did you kick my office door
‎like a donkey?

31:10.410 --> 31:12.036
‎Is this my doorknob?

31:12.120 --> 31:13.913
‎I did knock, 12 times.

31:13.997 --> 31:15.540
‎You didn't hear me because of your game.

31:15.623 --> 31:18.626
‎A Taekwondo master like you
‎should have better manners.

31:19.127 --> 31:21.087
‎Jeez!

31:22.213 --> 31:23.631
‎Everybody, fall in.

31:25.508 --> 31:27.010
‎What are you, a kid?

31:30.471 --> 31:32.181
‎This is an important battle, okay?

31:32.265 --> 31:33.558
‎You want to end up like that door?

31:33.641 --> 31:35.727
‎Kim should be getting off work now.

31:35.810 --> 31:37.520
‎Hurry up and go before I smash that.

31:37.604 --> 31:39.606
‎What does him getting off work
‎have to do with me?

31:40.815 --> 31:43.776
‎Today's the one day out of the year
‎we get together!

31:45.236 --> 31:46.112
‎That's today?

31:49.866 --> 31:51.159
‎Seriously, it's today?

31:52.285 --> 31:53.369
‎Oh man.

31:54.495 --> 31:55.830
‎I must be getting old.

31:55.914 --> 31:57.373
‎It slipped my mind.

31:57.457 --> 32:00.418
‎Come on. Let's go see how much he's aged.

32:01.210 --> 32:02.420
‎Goodness gracious.

32:02.503 --> 32:04.756
‎Hey, what are you going to do about this?

32:05.256 --> 32:06.215
‎Huh?

32:07.008 --> 32:07.967
‎Just stick it back in.

32:08.676 --> 32:10.553
‎"Just stick it back in"?

32:12.305 --> 32:13.473
‎I can just stick it in?

32:18.144 --> 32:20.647
‎All right.

32:20.730 --> 32:22.982
‎It's nice and cold. Drink up.

32:23.066 --> 32:24.317
‎Yeah, give me soju.

32:24.901 --> 32:25.985
‎Right here.

32:27.695 --> 32:31.407
‎That white Taekwondo uniform
‎is getting on my damn nerves.

32:31.491 --> 32:33.201
‎It's embarrassing.
‎Go sit over there alone.

32:33.284 --> 32:35.453
‎I came straight here
‎after dropping the kids off.

32:35.536 --> 32:37.330
‎Don't flip the meat yet.

32:39.374 --> 32:41.250
‎You're one to talk.
‎Take a look at yourself.

32:41.334 --> 32:43.086
‎Are you going on a mission after you eat?

32:43.920 --> 32:45.880
‎Hey, what's wrong with this?
‎You embarrassed?

32:45.964 --> 32:48.341
‎Who looks more ridiculous
‎between the two of us?

32:48.424 --> 32:51.219
‎I just need to take off my jacket.

32:51.302 --> 32:52.553
‎Wow.

32:52.637 --> 32:54.055
‎Look, it's Da-bin. Say hello.

32:54.138 --> 32:55.807
‎-Hi.
‎-Hi.

32:57.225 --> 32:59.143
‎I wear this because I miss my daughter.

32:59.227 --> 33:01.562
‎She's out and about all the time,

33:01.646 --> 33:03.106
‎so I never get to see her.

33:03.690 --> 33:05.817
‎But if I look in the mirror, I can say,

33:05.900 --> 33:08.695
‎"Hey, look who it is.
‎It's my daughter, Da-bin!"

33:08.778 --> 33:10.488
‎"It's me, your dad. Good to see you."

33:10.571 --> 33:12.198
‎"So, are you coming home today?"

33:12.281 --> 33:14.492
‎Da-bin seems embarrassed by you.

33:14.575 --> 33:15.785
‎She can't hold her head up.

33:15.868 --> 33:17.453
‎Let me help her with that.

33:17.537 --> 33:18.371
‎Hey.

33:18.454 --> 33:19.914
‎You're reminding me of the door.

33:19.998 --> 33:21.582
‎Do you need me
‎to put you in your place again?

33:28.840 --> 33:29.716
‎The meat is burning.

33:32.301 --> 33:33.302
‎You're ridiculous.

33:37.056 --> 33:40.226
‎No answer or anything. He just walks by.

33:40.309 --> 33:41.686
‎-Seriously?
‎-Here.

33:41.769 --> 33:43.980
‎-All right, all right.
‎-Let's drink.

33:44.063 --> 33:45.273
‎-Cheers.
‎-Cheers.

33:47.942 --> 33:52.321
‎I wonder who Tae-hun takes after
‎to be so rude.

33:52.405 --> 33:53.364
‎-You.
‎-You.

33:53.448 --> 33:55.366
‎Right, I'm rude.

34:02.290 --> 34:05.168
‎These drinks taste bittersweet tonight.

34:05.251 --> 34:06.919
‎But you know what?

34:07.003 --> 34:08.880
‎Raising Da-bin is what keeps me going.

34:08.963 --> 34:12.175
‎You know, I may not be as strong

34:12.258 --> 34:14.260
‎or as successful as before,

34:14.343 --> 34:15.678
‎but I like my life right now.

34:15.762 --> 34:17.513
‎-You punk.
‎-But I have to say,

34:17.597 --> 34:19.307
‎Da-bin grew up too quickly.

34:19.390 --> 34:22.101
‎She was such a cute little baby,

34:22.185 --> 34:24.479
‎but now that she's in high school,
‎she refuses to listen to me.

34:24.562 --> 34:25.980
‎Soon enough, she'll meet someone

34:26.898 --> 34:28.066
‎and get married, right?

34:28.691 --> 34:31.194
‎And we'll grow further apart, right?

34:32.779 --> 34:33.613
‎That just…

34:34.447 --> 34:37.158
‎Just thinking about it breaks my heart.

34:38.534 --> 34:39.535
‎Da-bin.

34:40.328 --> 34:42.288
‎Please don't leave me.

34:42.371 --> 34:45.625
‎You're not a fool for your daughter.
‎You're just a fool.

34:46.918 --> 34:47.752
‎I have to go.

34:47.835 --> 34:49.462
‎-Already?
‎-Already?

34:49.545 --> 34:50.630
‎Min-ji's alone.

34:50.713 --> 34:54.842
‎Hey, she might not like it
‎if you always rush home early.

34:55.593 --> 34:57.053
‎Don't drink too much and go home.

34:57.136 --> 34:58.846
‎-What's this?
‎-Give it to your kids.

34:58.930 --> 35:00.807
‎-Jeez, come on.
‎-You shouldn't have.

35:00.890 --> 35:02.391
‎-Hey, hold on.
‎-Wait a minute.

35:02.475 --> 35:04.977
‎Just sit down for a bit. Two more minutes.

35:05.061 --> 35:06.479
‎Don't be so cold.

35:09.190 --> 35:10.900
‎You didn't have to.

35:13.528 --> 35:16.239
‎Hey, Da-bin.
‎Your uncle gave you pocket money.

35:16.322 --> 35:18.407
‎-Listen, Kim.
‎-You should thank him.

35:18.491 --> 35:21.452
‎Let's see each other more often, okay?

35:21.536 --> 35:24.288
‎Seriously, once a year? That's ridiculous.

35:24.372 --> 35:26.707
‎If we meet once a year,

35:26.791 --> 35:30.378
‎-that's only 35 more times at best.
‎-That's true.

35:30.461 --> 35:34.841
‎I understand the decision you made
‎after your wife passed away,

35:34.924 --> 35:36.551
‎but you need to live your own life too.

35:36.634 --> 35:40.263
‎When will you stop making your daughter
‎the sole focus of your life?

35:40.346 --> 35:42.515
‎-Min-ji's grown up now.
‎-He's right.

35:42.598 --> 35:44.308
‎She'll have a boyfriend soon too.

35:44.392 --> 35:45.309
‎She's still a kid.

35:45.393 --> 35:48.396
‎The more you hover over your kids,

35:48.479 --> 35:50.898
‎the more suffocated they'll feel.

35:50.982 --> 35:53.234
‎Stop being so damn annoying!

35:54.402 --> 35:57.196
‎Come on, can't we have a quiet meal?

35:57.280 --> 35:59.157
‎He's pissing me off!

35:59.240 --> 36:01.492
‎-Can you just put out your cigarette?
‎-Why?

36:01.576 --> 36:03.578
‎This is a terrace!
‎Why do I have to put it out?

36:03.661 --> 36:05.746
‎There are other customers here.

36:05.830 --> 36:08.166
‎What other customers? Who?

36:08.916 --> 36:10.001
‎Who?

36:10.543 --> 36:11.752
‎Who?

36:14.630 --> 36:16.048
‎-Stop staring.
‎-What are you looking at?

36:16.132 --> 36:17.842
‎What? You pissed off?

36:21.470 --> 36:23.097
‎He must be really pissed.

36:25.224 --> 36:26.642
‎What?

36:27.518 --> 36:29.645
‎Don't. This has nothing to do with us.

36:29.729 --> 36:32.481
‎We're middle-aged men
‎who tolerate injustice.

36:32.565 --> 36:33.774
‎We're no longer young.

36:33.858 --> 36:35.818
‎We're just middle-aged men with glasses.

36:35.902 --> 36:36.903
‎Right?

36:36.986 --> 36:39.238
‎We already paid, so let's go.

36:39.322 --> 36:40.281
‎Come on.

36:40.364 --> 36:41.365
‎Get up.

36:42.617 --> 36:44.118
‎Hey, grunt! Where are you going?

36:44.202 --> 36:45.536
‎-Enough already.
‎-Let go of me.

36:45.620 --> 36:47.163
‎You off to scrub the slop bucket?

36:48.122 --> 36:50.124
‎Jin-cheol. You remember, right?

36:50.208 --> 36:51.042
‎Right.

36:51.959 --> 36:54.337
‎We're just middle-aged men with glasses.

36:56.088 --> 36:57.590
‎What? You scared?

37:00.593 --> 37:03.846
‎You were glaring at me earlier.

37:03.930 --> 37:05.473
‎Get over here, you asshole!

37:05.556 --> 37:07.600
‎Hey, grunt. Why don't you do some drills?

37:07.683 --> 37:08.768
‎Come on, give me 20 reps.

37:09.894 --> 37:11.103
‎One, two!

37:11.187 --> 37:12.313
‎What's that?

37:12.396 --> 37:14.357
‎This is embarrassing. Who's this?

37:14.440 --> 37:15.691
‎She's pretty!

37:16.192 --> 37:17.401
‎How cute.

37:18.653 --> 37:20.321
‎Why don't you introduce me to her?

37:21.155 --> 37:22.448
‎I'll treat her really well.

37:22.949 --> 37:24.951
‎Rock and roll!

37:29.455 --> 37:30.289
‎Jin-cheol.

37:38.214 --> 37:39.215
‎What the hell?

37:39.882 --> 37:41.634
‎You fat pig!

37:43.678 --> 37:45.137
‎Hey, pig, get up.

37:45.846 --> 37:47.098
‎Let me borrow your bag.

37:51.560 --> 37:53.521
‎Kim, shouldn't we stop him?

37:54.689 --> 37:55.898
‎Where did he go?

37:58.859 --> 38:02.071
‎Did you see a tall guy with glasses
‎in a depressing black suit?

38:03.281 --> 38:04.490
‎A tall guy.

38:07.243 --> 38:08.119
‎Hey, Kim…

38:09.787 --> 38:10.913
‎Fine, just go.

38:13.874 --> 38:15.126
‎Is this the police?

38:15.209 --> 38:17.169
‎There's a fight going on right now.

38:17.253 --> 38:19.422
‎Yes, a serious fight. Someone might die.

38:19.505 --> 38:20.840
‎Please hurry!

38:25.428 --> 38:28.514
‎No, no. You're dead if you use that.
‎No, don't do that.

38:36.188 --> 38:38.566
‎He should run. Is he frozen or something?

39:04.842 --> 39:06.093
‎Stop.

39:06.719 --> 39:07.553
‎Stop!

39:14.185 --> 39:17.063
‎Officer, shoot something!

39:17.146 --> 39:19.190
‎-Shoot your gun!
‎-Gun?

39:19.273 --> 39:21.942
‎Shoot something! Anything! Hurry!

39:24.070 --> 39:25.279
‎Hurry!

39:41.670 --> 39:43.589
‎Whose jacket is this? "Kim Nam-hoon"?

39:43.672 --> 39:45.341
‎-What are you doing?
‎-Who's Kim Nam-hoon?

39:45.424 --> 39:46.967
‎I don't know.

39:47.051 --> 39:49.095
‎What's the matter with you?

39:49.762 --> 39:50.971
‎Have a good day.

39:54.892 --> 39:57.019
‎Min-ji's grown up now.

39:57.103 --> 39:58.646
‎He's right.
‎She'll have a boyfriend soon too.

39:59.230 --> 40:01.315
‎Does she have a boyfriend?

40:12.993 --> 40:14.036
‎Hey.

40:14.829 --> 40:16.872
‎Do you know where Kim Nam-hoon is?

40:19.208 --> 40:20.042
‎I'm not sure.

40:26.048 --> 40:27.216
‎I need to give this back.

40:35.724 --> 40:38.477
‎-You could've left it on my desk.
‎-What?

40:38.561 --> 40:39.979
‎You were looking for me, right?

40:40.062 --> 40:42.440
‎Oh, I just wanted to thank you.

40:43.816 --> 40:45.276
‎-That's it?
‎-Well…

40:45.359 --> 40:46.694
‎I can give you this.

40:50.948 --> 40:52.283
‎Really? Strawberry milk?

40:52.366 --> 40:53.534
‎What am I, a kid?

41:09.842 --> 41:11.177
‎You're the one who liked my post, right?

41:11.260 --> 41:12.094
‎What?

41:13.220 --> 41:14.305
‎I'm not on social media.

41:15.723 --> 41:16.932
‎Oh, yeah?

41:30.362 --> 41:31.489
‎Then what's this?

41:31.572 --> 41:32.656
‎KIM NAM-HOON

41:35.242 --> 41:36.327
‎I can DM you, right?

41:37.703 --> 41:38.537
‎Yeah.

41:39.163 --> 41:40.623
‎Never mind. You should DM me first.

41:40.706 --> 41:41.540
‎Hey.

41:41.624 --> 41:44.126
‎But you have to DM me back.

41:44.210 --> 41:45.252
‎I'll think about it.

41:45.336 --> 41:47.505
‎-Why? What's there to think about?
‎-What?

41:47.588 --> 41:49.256
‎Why can't I think about it?

41:49.340 --> 41:52.092
‎You can't do that.
‎You told me to DM you first.

42:07.525 --> 42:08.901
‎Come out. Hye-ri wants to see you.

42:10.569 --> 42:11.487
‎Get up.

42:28.921 --> 42:29.964
‎You know why I hit you, right?

42:31.173 --> 42:33.634
‎Hye-ri asked you a question. Answer her.

42:37.888 --> 42:38.931
‎You still don't know?

42:39.014 --> 42:42.601
‎You hit on Hye-ri's boyfriend,
‎you sly bitch.

42:42.685 --> 42:43.602
‎I never did that.

42:43.686 --> 42:45.729
‎All I did was return his gym clothes.

42:46.814 --> 42:50.651
‎Why did you borrow them
‎in the first place?

42:51.443 --> 42:52.736
‎Who do you think you are?

42:52.820 --> 42:55.281
‎Why didn't you wear
‎your own goddamn gym clothes?

42:56.407 --> 42:58.200
‎Because you guys threw them in the trash.

43:01.287 --> 43:02.788
‎Don't worry.

43:02.871 --> 43:04.373
‎I have no reason to contact him.

43:05.040 --> 43:06.584
‎I don't want anything to do with you.

43:16.844 --> 43:19.346
‎Hey, it seems like you're mistaken.

43:19.430 --> 43:23.350
‎I'm not pissed
‎because you tried to take my toy.

43:23.434 --> 43:25.561
‎It's because of your stench.

43:26.395 --> 43:28.314
‎I'm pissed because it'll rub off on him.

43:29.231 --> 43:30.399
‎She has no idea.

43:31.400 --> 43:32.318
‎Grab her.

43:36.155 --> 43:37.406
‎Get up.

43:39.450 --> 43:42.411
‎How do I describe this smell?

43:52.880 --> 43:55.758
‎It's like a cheap suit

43:56.842 --> 43:59.678
‎shoved in the back of a closet…

44:00.888 --> 44:01.805
‎Oh, I know.

44:03.515 --> 44:04.933
‎It's the smell of a motherless child.

44:14.568 --> 44:15.694
‎Hey.

44:15.778 --> 44:18.656
‎-You think you know me?!
‎-You crazy bitch!

44:18.739 --> 44:20.324
‎Who do you think you are?!

44:21.492 --> 44:22.701
‎Who do you think you are? Huh?!

44:24.620 --> 44:26.955
‎-Hye-ri, are you okay?
‎-Who the hell do you think you are?!

44:31.752 --> 44:33.170
‎Hey!

44:33.253 --> 44:35.297
‎You think you know me so well?!

44:36.090 --> 44:38.008
‎-What the hell do you know?!
‎-Get off her!

44:38.092 --> 44:40.135
‎-Get off her already!
‎-Stop!

44:40.219 --> 44:43.180
‎It wasn't just a fight.
‎It was an assault, Mr. Kim.

44:43.263 --> 44:46.266
‎Min-ji just attacked her.

44:46.350 --> 44:48.769
‎I'll be right there.

44:48.852 --> 44:49.895
‎Please hurry.

44:50.521 --> 44:52.690
‎I'm about to lose my job.

44:54.441 --> 44:55.818
‎Why did it have to be Hye-ri?

44:55.901 --> 45:00.280
‎The victim's father is the chairman
‎of Juhak Construction.

45:00.364 --> 45:01.824
‎You've heard of them, right?

45:05.744 --> 45:07.162
‎You built this hotel as well,

45:07.704 --> 45:09.081
‎didn't you, Chairman Ju?

45:10.874 --> 45:11.708
‎Yes.

45:13.168 --> 45:15.462
‎My daughter had graduated
‎from elementary school,

45:16.547 --> 45:17.881
‎so it was about four years ago.

45:17.965 --> 45:21.009
‎Oh, you have a daughter.

45:21.093 --> 45:23.679
‎She must be pretty if she takes after you.

45:24.888 --> 45:25.722
‎You're too kind.

45:26.807 --> 45:31.061
‎Anyway, this is the first time
‎I've had a meeting in a spa.

45:31.145 --> 45:34.523
‎There's no need to watch what we say
‎or hide anything here.

45:36.859 --> 45:37.860
‎All right, then.

45:38.819 --> 45:40.904
‎Let me ask you point-blank.

45:40.988 --> 45:44.283
‎What's in it for me
‎if this redevelopment plan goes through?

45:44.366 --> 45:48.120
‎It'll provide a better living environment
‎for your constituents.

45:48.203 --> 45:49.371
‎And?

45:50.372 --> 45:51.623
‎It'll create

45:53.292 --> 45:56.044
‎a much more favorable environment
‎for your political fundraising.

45:57.838 --> 45:59.506
‎Twice as much as last time.

46:06.054 --> 46:08.140
‎All right. Let's do this together.

46:08.223 --> 46:13.979
‎There must be something in the water.
‎I feel refreshed to my very core.

46:15.063 --> 46:16.648
‎I should get going now.

46:17.774 --> 46:18.817
‎Please take your time.

46:24.031 --> 46:25.491
‎Goodness, Chairman Ju.

46:25.574 --> 46:27.242
‎What happened to your body?

46:27.326 --> 46:29.536
‎Oh, it's not a pretty sight, is it?

46:31.497 --> 46:34.333
‎I got some tattoos on a whim
‎when I was younger,

46:35.584 --> 46:37.377
‎but I regretted them
‎after I started my business.

46:38.086 --> 46:39.421
‎I was ashamed to show my daughter too.

46:40.756 --> 46:43.133
‎So I just burned them off myself
‎with a torch.

46:44.134 --> 46:46.053
‎With a torch?

46:46.678 --> 46:49.097
‎Why didn't you go to a hospital?

46:50.265 --> 46:53.602
‎I guess it was a pledge
‎not to go back to my old life.

46:53.685 --> 46:57.689
‎But still, it must've been very painful.

47:00.359 --> 47:03.987
‎It was nothing compared to what I've done
‎to make it this far.

47:04.571 --> 47:05.405
‎It was more painful…

47:07.699 --> 47:10.285
‎for those who didn't keep
‎their promises with me

47:10.369 --> 47:12.120
‎and disappeared as a result.

47:18.710 --> 47:20.337
‎I'm counting on you, Assemblyman Sim.

47:20.420 --> 47:22.256
‎Right, yes, of course.

47:28.512 --> 47:30.764
‎Sir, your wife is calling.

47:36.270 --> 47:38.397
‎-What is it?
‎-Honey, something terrible happened.

47:38.480 --> 47:39.690
‎Hye-ri…

47:39.773 --> 47:43.277
‎Hye-ri was assaulted by someone at school!

47:44.903 --> 47:45.821
‎Okay.

47:50.325 --> 47:51.285
‎Let's go to Hye-ri's school.

47:51.910 --> 47:53.161
‎Yes, sir.

48:18.437 --> 48:19.688
‎You can't go in.

48:21.815 --> 48:24.943
‎The chairman asked me to come, asshole.

48:25.027 --> 48:26.320
‎Hey, Nam.

48:27.112 --> 48:28.113
‎What's the matter with them?

48:28.196 --> 48:29.156
‎Be quiet.

48:30.157 --> 48:31.700
‎The chairman is inside.

48:34.995 --> 48:35.871
‎You told me to come.

48:35.954 --> 48:37.372
‎So I came.

48:37.456 --> 48:38.790
‎There's been a change of plans.

48:39.541 --> 48:40.792
‎I'll get back to you.

48:45.047 --> 48:48.675
‎Am I some lapdog
‎you can just order around?

48:56.183 --> 48:57.351
‎I thought you knew already.

48:57.976 --> 48:58.977
‎No, I didn't.

49:05.275 --> 49:06.485
‎I didn't know that.

49:08.570 --> 49:09.821
‎This lapdog is leaving.

49:11.823 --> 49:13.575
‎Goddamn it.

49:16.536 --> 49:18.330
‎When in the world is he arriving?

49:20.749 --> 49:22.000
‎Let's go, Hye-ri.

49:22.084 --> 49:24.586
‎How dare he make us wait?

49:25.212 --> 49:26.129
‎Sit down.

49:27.172 --> 49:28.465
‎We should at least talk to him.

49:33.428 --> 49:36.306
‎What took you so long?

49:43.897 --> 49:47.359
‎How on earth did you raise your child
‎for her to act this way?

49:48.318 --> 49:49.986
‎Just look at my child!

49:50.070 --> 49:52.489
‎How can I send her to school now?

49:53.365 --> 49:54.491
‎Why won't you look at her?

49:55.075 --> 49:57.661
‎Take a good look at her!

50:02.499 --> 50:03.542
‎I'm sorry.

50:03.625 --> 50:06.128
‎I've only heard about
‎school violence and bullies.

50:06.211 --> 50:10.215
‎I had no idea Hye-ri was in the same class
‎as someone like her!

50:10.298 --> 50:12.467
‎Dad, I didn't do anything wrong.

50:12.551 --> 50:14.428
‎She and her girls kept harassing me.

50:14.511 --> 50:16.763
‎I took it for as long as I could
‎before fighting back!

50:16.847 --> 50:17.764
‎Kim Min-ji.

50:19.558 --> 50:20.475
‎Be quiet.

50:20.559 --> 50:22.769
‎But she hit me first!

50:22.853 --> 50:23.687
‎Don't you believe me?

50:24.521 --> 50:25.355
‎Min-ji.

50:27.733 --> 50:32.529
‎Mr. Kim, I think you should
‎come to an agreement with the victim.

50:32.612 --> 50:34.948
‎No, forget it.

50:35.031 --> 50:37.200
‎I demand a disciplinary hearing,

50:37.284 --> 50:38.994
‎and I want this on her record.

50:45.625 --> 50:47.169
‎Dad!

50:51.965 --> 50:53.592
‎Don't you have any pride at all?

50:54.509 --> 50:55.343
‎I'm sorry.

50:55.427 --> 50:57.220
‎I've fallen short as a parent

50:58.054 --> 50:59.347
‎since I'm raising her alone.

51:00.015 --> 51:02.434
‎As a fellow parent raising a daughter,

51:02.517 --> 51:04.895
‎I ask that you find it in your heart
‎to forgive us.

51:07.230 --> 51:08.857
‎I'll take responsibility as her father,

51:10.525 --> 51:11.526
‎and have her transferred.

51:11.610 --> 51:12.694
‎Dad!

51:19.284 --> 51:21.203
‎As a fellow parent raising a daughter,
‎you say?

51:32.172 --> 51:33.006
‎Right.

51:36.843 --> 51:38.470
‎It's not easy raising a daughter.

51:43.099 --> 51:44.184
‎Especially on your own.

51:46.895 --> 51:49.064
‎It must've been hard
‎growing up without a mother.

51:50.315 --> 51:52.818
‎It's natural for kids to fight
‎while growing up.

51:56.488 --> 51:57.864
‎We received an apology,

51:57.948 --> 51:59.866
‎so let's settle this matter
‎with her transferring.

51:59.950 --> 52:00.784
‎-Dad!
‎-Honey!

52:00.867 --> 52:01.952
‎We'll leave it at this.

52:05.080 --> 52:05.914
‎Thank you.

52:17.801 --> 52:18.635
‎Min-ji.

52:21.179 --> 52:22.389
‎Kim Min-ji.

52:23.348 --> 52:24.182
‎KIM NAM-HOON

52:37.571 --> 52:39.573
‎What does her father do?

52:40.198 --> 52:43.702
‎I believe he's an ordinary office worker.

52:43.785 --> 52:47.330
‎Thank you for your leniency, Chairman Ju.

52:48.039 --> 52:51.084
‎Thank you. This will never happen again.

52:53.461 --> 52:54.421
‎Of course.

52:54.504 --> 52:56.548
‎Because if something like this
‎happens again,

52:58.008 --> 53:00.010
‎this school and all of you will disappear.

53:19.112 --> 53:19.988
‎Min-ji.

53:22.073 --> 53:23.116
‎Are you hungry?

53:24.242 --> 53:25.368
‎Should we go eat?

53:27.662 --> 53:28.538
‎Min-ji.

53:29.623 --> 53:30.624
‎Kim Min-ji.

53:34.920 --> 53:36.671
‎Why won't you believe me?

53:37.505 --> 53:38.882
‎Of course, I believe you.

53:38.965 --> 53:41.134
‎Then why do I have to transfer?

53:41.217 --> 53:42.886
‎I didn't do anything wrong.

53:45.639 --> 53:47.891
‎Why did you have to grovel and kneel?

53:48.475 --> 53:50.518
‎Is it because Hye-ri's dad
‎is a powerful man?

53:51.269 --> 53:52.854
‎I'm so ashamed.

53:53.855 --> 53:56.733
‎I feel so angry, frustrated, and pathetic.

53:57.817 --> 53:59.569
‎What have you done with your life?

54:01.196 --> 54:03.782
‎Her dad's a rich chairman
‎with lots of connections,

54:04.574 --> 54:07.202
‎but why are you a lowly office worker?

54:08.411 --> 54:10.121
‎Why did you even have me?

54:11.998 --> 54:12.832
‎Min-ji.

54:12.916 --> 54:13.959
‎As my dad…

54:16.002 --> 54:17.170
‎As my dad…

54:24.010 --> 54:26.680
‎As my dad, you mean the world to me.

54:27.639 --> 54:28.932
‎I don't have a mom.

54:29.516 --> 54:31.101
‎You're all I have left,

54:32.310 --> 54:34.062
‎but if you're not on my side…

54:34.145 --> 54:36.147
‎They're the bad ones.

54:36.773 --> 54:39.651
‎You, of all people, should've believed me.

54:44.656 --> 54:45.573
‎Let's go home.

54:45.657 --> 54:47.158
‎I don't want to be with you.

54:47.742 --> 54:49.786
‎I'm staying at Hye-ryeong's tonight,

54:49.869 --> 54:51.162
‎so don't call me.

54:51.246 --> 54:52.747
‎If you do,

54:53.957 --> 54:55.709
‎I'll run away from home.

54:57.669 --> 54:58.586
‎Min-ji.

55:00.422 --> 55:02.007
‎It's your birthday tomorrow.

55:02.841 --> 55:03.675
‎Kim Min-ji!

55:11.307 --> 55:13.226
‎I hate my birthday.

55:16.813 --> 55:18.481
‎It's the day Mom died.

55:52.057 --> 55:53.308
‎THE LATE IM YU-JIN

56:15.038 --> 56:17.082
‎These flowers are my favorite.

56:17.665 --> 56:18.875
‎They're called honeysuckles.

56:19.375 --> 56:20.919
‎The meaning behind them is pretty too.

56:21.961 --> 56:23.088
‎Do you know what it is?

56:23.671 --> 56:24.506
‎What is it?

56:25.173 --> 56:26.007
‎Love and…

56:26.841 --> 56:27.801
‎-‎devotion.
‎-Devotion.

56:33.848 --> 56:36.392
‎I'm sorry, Yu-jin.

57:40.582 --> 57:42.125
‎I have something to tell you.

57:42.208 --> 57:44.169
‎I'll be at the back gate at school.

57:44.252 --> 57:45.712
‎I'll wait until you get here.

58:28.588 --> 58:31.925
‎DAD

58:33.885 --> 58:36.846
‎The person you are trying to reach
‎is unavailable. You will be redirected…

58:37.889 --> 58:39.599
‎I don't want to be with you.

58:40.308 --> 58:42.435
‎I'm staying at Hye-ryeong's tonight,

58:42.519 --> 58:43.811
‎so don't call me.

58:45.188 --> 58:46.356
‎If you do,

58:47.565 --> 58:49.150
‎I'll run away from home.

59:18.012 --> 59:21.766
‎The phone you are calling is turned off.
‎You will be redirected to voicemail.

59:36.155 --> 59:37.407
‎Hello?

59:37.490 --> 59:38.324
‎Hello?

59:39.117 --> 59:40.410
‎Is this Kang Hye-ryeong?

59:40.493 --> 59:42.287
‎Yes. Who is this?

59:42.370 --> 59:44.330
‎I'm Min-ji's dad.

59:44.414 --> 59:47.792
‎What? How did you know my number?

59:49.335 --> 59:51.170
‎Min-ji told me.

59:51.963 --> 59:54.632
‎Hye-ryeong, by any chance,

59:54.716 --> 59:56.509
‎were you with Min-ji last night?

59:56.593 --> 59:57.552
‎No.

59:59.512 --> 01:00:02.515
‎Then have you heard from her at all?

01:00:02.599 --> 01:00:04.017
‎No.

01:00:04.100 --> 01:00:05.268
‎I'm hanging up now.

01:00:33.630 --> 01:00:35.506
‎Hey, I'm Min-ji's dad.

01:00:36.090 --> 01:00:37.300
‎Have you seen her?

01:00:40.720 --> 01:00:43.264
‎No, she hasn't come to school yet.

01:00:52.940 --> 01:00:54.108
‎Kim Nam-hoon?

01:00:55.109 --> 01:00:57.612
‎Did you meet Min-ji yesterday?

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:02.241
‎I didn't send her that DM.

01:01:02.867 --> 01:01:04.327
‎hey were these thugs…

01:01:05.453 --> 01:01:07.455
‎I only heard something
‎about the back gate.

01:01:08.373 --> 01:01:09.499
‎I'm sorry.

01:01:10.416 --> 01:01:12.543
‎I couldn't do anything

01:01:12.627 --> 01:01:14.003
‎because they took my phone.

01:02:24.282 --> 01:02:27.827
‎How on earth did you raise your child
‎for her to act this way?

01:03:04.572 --> 01:03:06.491
‎We just have to act like
‎we don't know anything.

01:03:06.574 --> 01:03:08.618
‎I told everyone to keep quiet,
‎so don't worry.

01:03:08.701 --> 01:03:11.245
‎-But you never know.
‎-Just trust me.

01:03:11.329 --> 01:03:12.997
‎You know I'm not some low-life thug.

01:03:14.957 --> 01:03:16.501
‎Hey, it's all clean now.

01:03:17.084 --> 01:03:19.128
‎See? Even the weather is on our side.

01:03:20.588 --> 01:03:23.049
‎If someone reported it,
‎the cops would be here already.

01:03:23.132 --> 01:03:24.217
‎Nobody will find her.

01:03:24.300 --> 01:03:26.093
‎And you said her dad's a loser, right?

01:03:27.094 --> 01:03:29.806
‎-Can I ask a question?
‎-Damn it, you scared me!

01:03:30.348 --> 01:03:32.809
‎I'm Min-ji's dad.

01:03:33.935 --> 01:03:36.187
‎We don't know where she is,
‎so just go on your way.

01:03:37.271 --> 01:03:39.440
‎I never said I was looking for her.

01:03:44.612 --> 01:03:47.406
‎This is your hair tie, right?

01:03:47.490 --> 01:03:48.449
‎It was on the ground.

01:03:52.787 --> 01:03:56.457
‎I said go on your way
‎unless you want your ass kicked!

01:03:56.541 --> 01:03:58.793
‎-It's yours, right?
‎-Goddamn it.

01:04:08.845 --> 01:04:09.971
‎Look at you.

01:04:11.180 --> 01:04:13.558
‎-You're dead meat.
‎-I'll ask you one last time.

01:04:14.976 --> 01:04:16.644
‎-Where's Min-ji?
‎-Hey, old man.

01:04:16.727 --> 01:04:17.854
‎What do you think?

01:04:18.437 --> 01:04:19.313
‎Huh?

01:04:19.397 --> 01:04:21.148
‎Is it clocking to you that you're screwed?

01:04:25.361 --> 01:04:28.030
‎Who the hell do you think you are?

01:04:28.114 --> 01:04:29.073
‎You think you're special?

01:04:29.156 --> 01:04:31.951
‎Show me, then.
‎Take off your clothes and fight.

01:04:32.034 --> 01:04:33.703
‎Want me to take it off for you?

01:04:35.913 --> 01:04:36.914
‎Let me go!

01:04:37.790 --> 01:04:39.458
‎Put down the gun.

01:04:40.167 --> 01:04:41.669
‎Let me go.

01:04:42.795 --> 01:04:44.714
‎Discharge me right now!

01:04:50.928 --> 01:04:51.846
‎You can't discharge him.

01:04:51.929 --> 01:04:53.556
‎You know as well as I do, sir.

01:04:53.639 --> 01:04:56.475
‎No one can ever know he exists.

01:04:56.559 --> 01:04:58.352
‎Codename 66.

01:04:58.436 --> 01:04:59.854
‎A North Korean operative who defected

01:04:59.937 --> 01:05:01.814
‎and was recruited
‎by South Korean intelligence.

01:05:01.898 --> 01:05:03.566
‎He acted as a double agent
‎on five occasions

01:05:03.649 --> 01:05:05.610
‎and has been credited with
‎17 infiltration missions in the North.

01:05:05.693 --> 01:05:09.071
‎He led the assassination operation
‎targeting North Korea's supreme commander,

01:05:09.155 --> 01:05:12.325
‎prompting China and Russia
‎to assign teams to track him.

01:05:14.243 --> 01:05:15.119
‎What the hell?

01:05:36.432 --> 01:05:38.768
‎Discharging someone like him
‎is unthinkable.

01:05:38.851 --> 01:05:41.646
‎If the North finds out he's still alive,

01:05:41.729 --> 01:05:43.356
‎his existence alone…

01:05:44.440 --> 01:05:45.858
‎will cause a diplomatic crisis.

01:05:52.782 --> 01:05:53.991
‎Tell me.

01:05:55.576 --> 01:05:56.577
‎Where's Min-ji?

01:06:37.868 --> 01:06:41.497
‎AGENT KIM REACTIVATED

01:06:42.248 --> 01:06:43.624
‎-The law?
‎-Who the hell are you?

01:06:44.834 --> 01:06:45.668
‎I guess…

01:06:48.671 --> 01:06:50.339
‎I'll just be a middle-aged outlaw.

01:06:50.923 --> 01:06:53.342
‎The government denies
‎Agent Kim's existence.

01:06:53.426 --> 01:06:54.552
‎Arm the infiltration team.

01:06:55.803 --> 01:06:56.846
‎Hey, mister!

01:06:58.055 --> 01:07:00.266
‎Is that bastard sleeping right now?

01:07:00.349 --> 01:07:01.517
‎In this situation?

01:07:02.059 --> 01:07:04.437
‎I'm only keeping you alive
‎because I believe my daughter is.

01:07:07.148 --> 01:07:08.941
‎-Daddy!
‎-Is that you, Min-ji?

01:07:10.818 --> 01:07:12.319
‎I took care of the girl's body.

01:07:14.864 --> 01:07:19.577
‎Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim
